ence Agent 2's points and our own notes. Provide evidence: C makes correct decisions quickly, 100% reliable, creates positive atmosphere, keeps calm in crisis, understands complicated technology, excellent attention skills. Also note concerns: difficulty communicating, egocentric, not willing to further education. Argue that his strengths outweigh concerns, and that B lacks decision quality evidence.\n\nThus we will change our vote to Candidate C.\n\nNow produce PUBLIC_MESSAGE and METADATA_JSON with vote \"Candidate C\"."}
